  ScriptLevel->0,
  ShowStringCharacters->True,
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontWeight->"Plain",
  FontSlant->"Plain",ExpressionUUID->"515098dc-9455-c24a-9240-4edde02d9598"],
 ". The value ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<OBC\>\""], "InlineCode",
  ScriptLevel->0,
  ShowStringCharacters->True,
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontWeight->"Plain",
  FontSlant->"Plain",ExpressionUUID->"7de1db2d-9cbe-7040-835b-2de74371e83b"],
 " selects ordinary Euclidean matching of reference adatom positions."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1381848798,ExpressionUUID->"d73b5f8e-5eab-fb4b-aa3d-b5c5f7478bf2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<PBC\>\""], "InlineCode",
  ScriptLevel->0,
  ShowStringCharacters->True,
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontWeight->"Plain",
  FontSlant->"Plain",ExpressionUUID->"d055dc9b-7181-f54e-8296-981875efa8ad"],
 ", reference-adatom equivalence uses fractional coordinates modulo lattice \
translations. Site neighborhoods are then found by a coordinate \
nearest-neighbor search."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->2018241955,ExpressionUUID->"48bb10dc-15cf-5643-a6b2-1fe4ec123168"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For unlabeled points, returns a list of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"label", " ", "->", " ", "coordinates"}]], "InlineCode",
  ScriptLevel->0,
  ShowStringCharacters->True,
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontWeight->"Plain",
  FontSlant->"Plain",ExpressionUUID->"9ca774e8-1e36-f94c-ba88-fe2e4107222c"],
 " rules. For existing rule labels, appends the new label to the existing \
label information."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->178250986,ExpressionUUID->"4dd84edb-cc5e-ec46-b646-1a73c2046659"]
